{
  "id": "section-life",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Life\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,958,963]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Life is a measure of the physical\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,963,997]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "punishment you can take. You take\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,997,1031]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "wounds when you are hit in combat\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1031,1065]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or when you are hurt by falls,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1065,1096]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "disease, or any other natural and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1096,1130]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "supernatural sources of damage. If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1130,1165]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "your Life total reaches zero, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1165,1199]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "die and your game ends.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1199,1223]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "During the game, you may prevent\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1223,1256]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the loss of 1 or 2 Life points by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1256,1290]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolling on the Injury table. This will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1290,1329]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "inflict some sort of lasting Injury\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1329,1365]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "on your character. Once you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1365,1398]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "received three lasting Injuries in the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1398,1437]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "lifetime of a character, you may no\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1437,1473]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "longer prevent the loss of Life by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1473,1508]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolling on the Injury table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1508,1537]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Between games, all your wounds\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1537,1568]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "heal and your Life total goes back\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1568,1603]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to its starting maximum value, but\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1603,1638]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Injuries remain. In a few cases,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1638,1671]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "miracles or healing powers may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1671,1702]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "remove your Injuries, but that’s a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1702,1737]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-life:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rare event -- don’t count on it.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,1737,1770]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    10
  ]
}
